    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE GAMES</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Art Games Studio</strong></h2><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/fa31f02d9dee8cc23a62b5b33276ac7e.poster.avif?t=1724734829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/fa31f02d9dee8cc23a62b5b33276ac7e.webm?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/fa31f02d9dee8cc23a62b5b33276ac7e.mp4?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Invirium is an action shooter game with randomly generated levels and elements from the roguelike genre. You are the cell that needs to eliminate dangerous pathogens in the human body. During the gameplay, you'll find interesting items that will help you upgrade/add new abilities to fight against tons of microorganisms.<br><br><strong>MICROORGANISM</strong><br>You will find a lot of inner body enemies like bacterias, viruses, or fungus. Be patient and vigilant against them - each has unique qualities which might annihilate you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/43936006fb27064f8e1676f12867e185.poster.avif?t=1724734829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/43936006fb27064f8e1676f12867e185.webm?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/43936006fb27064f8e1676f12867e185.mp4?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>ORGANS</strong><br>You will lurk many organs like the intestines, kidneys, or liver to eliminate pathogens. Explore and find life references to the human body.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/e1911493df47f7a028db99fcb2abd8fa.poster.avif?t=1724734829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/e1911493df47f7a028db99fcb2abd8fa.webm?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/e1911493df47f7a028db99fcb2abd8fa.mp4?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>MEDICAL NEWS</strong><br>Apart from cool gameplay, you can find useful information about medical news in this game world &quot;Virofarium&quot; and more!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/bbf3e9dc0e07bc142a94c9c1d10c6411.poster.avif?t=1724734829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/bbf3e9dc0e07bc142a94c9c1d10c6411.webm?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/bbf3e9dc0e07bc142a94c9c1d10c6411.mp4?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/fa31f02d9dee8cc23a62b5b33276ac7e.poster.avif?t=1724734829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/fa31f02d9dee8cc23a62b5b33276ac7e.webm?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/fa31f02d9dee8cc23a62b5b33276ac7e.mp4?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Invirium is an action shooter game with randomly generated levels and elements from the roguelike genre. You are the cell that needs to eliminate dangerous pathogens in the human body. During the gameplay, you'll find interesting items that will help you upgrade/add new abilities to fight against tons of microorganisms.<br><br><strong>MICROORGANISM</strong><br>You will find a lot of inner body enemies like bacterias, viruses, or fungus. Be patient and vigilant against them - each has unique qualities which might annihilate you.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/43936006fb27064f8e1676f12867e185.poster.avif?t=1724734829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/43936006fb27064f8e1676f12867e185.webm?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/43936006fb27064f8e1676f12867e185.mp4?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>ORGANS</strong><br>You will lurk many organs like the intestines, kidneys, or liver to eliminate pathogens. Explore and find life references to the human body.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/e1911493df47f7a028db99fcb2abd8fa.poster.avif?t=1724734829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/e1911493df47f7a028db99fcb2abd8fa.webm?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/e1911493df47f7a028db99fcb2abd8fa.mp4?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>MEDICAL NEWS</strong><br>Apart from cool gameplay, you can find useful information about medical news in this game world &quot;Virofarium&quot; and more!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/bbf3e9dc0e07bc142a94c9c1d10c6411.poster.avif?t=1724734829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/bbf3e9dc0e07bc142a94c9c1d10c6411.webm?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492300/extras/bbf3e9dc0e07bc142a94c9c1d10c6411.mp4?t=1724734829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
